****************Best Practices-Start****************
Use the Claude app or create a “System Architect” agent in Claude Code and brainstorm deeply with it, asking the AI to draw this blueprint (HTML or SVG) and edit it until it truly reflects what you expect.

If editing with AI seems too time-consuming for you, then it’s best to try doing it manually. You can use Excalidraw, a powerful and easy-to-use web app for this task.
https://faafospecialist.substack.com/p/vb-07-claude-code-common-mistakes

only implement features when they are actually needed, not when we think they might be needed in the future. The idea is to avoid over-design and keep things simple.


****************Best Practices-End****************

Read about YAGNI - KISS - DRY from internet and this URL. Learn about these principles, and then “make it hoist by its own petard”: ask it to write the necessary rules of these 3 principles into CLAUDE.md or certain Commands - 
https://faafospecialist.substack.com/p/vb-07-claude-code-common-mistakes

